{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10106130","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10106130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1010613001:2":{"text":"이 포도밭... 어떻게 된 일이죠?!","source_cn":"你们，这片葡萄田是怎么回事？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFFA1678A89F8D0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1010613002:2":{"text":"...진정해, 왜 갑자기 흥분하고 그래?","source_cn":"……你冷静点，怎么突然这么激动？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE0D9C93587208CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010613003:1":{"text":"당신들이 로드 프란츠님이 체포됐다는 소문을 퍼뜨렸어?","source_cn":"就是你们传言说弗朗茨老爷被逮捕了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEBE65A7E36FB313","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010613004:1":{"text":"웃기시네! 귀족들과도 왕래가 있는 부자를 쉽게 감옥으로 보낼 수 있을 것 같아?","source_cn":"笑话，他家财万贯，和各方贵族都有往来，怎么会那么简单入狱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x433D8052803BCAE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010613005:1":{"text":"로드 프란츠님께서 돌아오시면 우리 일을 검사하실 거야! 그러니 귀찮게 굴지 말고 저리 꺼져!","source_cn":"等弗朗茨老爷被放出来，就该盘查我们的工作了，别来惹麻烦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9264CDEC5EDC236B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010613006:1":{"text":"대답하세요. 이 포도들도 로드 프란츠가 심은 건가요?! 언제 심은 거죠!?","source_cn":"回答我，这些葡萄也是弗朗茨种的吗？！什么时候？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA387E1E6170B2204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010613007:0":{"text":"교대하던 사람이 말하기를, <style=\"highlight\">3년 전</style> 어떤 검은 옷을 입은 여자와 함께 심었다고...","source_cn":"听之前换班的人说，<style=highlight>三...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E61674D7F06E59B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010613008:1":{"text":"시끄러워, 입 다물지 못해?! \n당신에게 대답할 의무 없으니 당장 꺼져!","source_cn":"闭嘴，别什么都往外说！\\n我们没义务回答你，快滚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92E2FAF156A7C691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010613009:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">3년 전</style>이면 남촌에 포도를 대규모로 심기 전인데...?! <style=\"highlight\">내 고향</style>에서...","source_cn":"<style=highlight>三年前，</styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x080D68BE9FB2A764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1010613009":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">3년 전</style>이면 남촌에 포도를 대규모로 심기 전인데...?! <style=\"highlight\">내 고향</style>에서...","source_cn":"<style=highlight>三年前，</style>那就是在南村大规模种植葡萄之前……？！在<style=highlight>我的家乡</style>被——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x080D68BE9FB2A764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010613010:1":{"text":"이게 도대체 무슨 일인지... 확실히 알아봐야겠어요!","source_cn":"这究竟是怎么回事……我一定要问个清楚！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x858867BE9576B7AF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이게 도대체 무슨 일인지... 확실히 알아봐야겠어요!","female":"이게 도대체 무슨 일인지... 확실히 알아봐야겠어요!","variant_male_record_index":"97162","variant_female_record_index":"97163","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010613011:1":{"text":"남촌의 포도와 관련 있다면 확실히 조사해 봐야죠. \n저 사람들은 입을 열지 않으니 다른 방법으로 접근해보는 게 좋겠어요.","source_cn":"既然和南村的葡萄有关，调查清楚也好。\\n要是他们不肯说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FAFB5295DA1C791","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1010613012:1":{"text":"...걱정들 말아요. 살살할 테니까!","source_cn":"——放心，我会手下留情的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC406C51D855914B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"로잔, 침착해","source_cn":"洛桑，冷静点","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD2B2633A199F18DB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"로잔, 침착해","female":"로잔, 침착해","variant_male_record_index":"58654","variant_female_record_index":"58655","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"